3 Types
Tables sits on the 3rd level of the Catalog.

> Managed = All taken care by Databricks.Performance, Storage performance and unity compatibility.
      Features: 
              Predective Optimize: Based on the patter, databricks runs the optimize command on the tables. Enabled by default. 
                                   If the property is enabled on the catalog it can be inherited to schemas and eventually to tables.
                                   Alter Catalog catalog_name (enable | disabled | Inherit) predective optimization
                                   Alter scehma|database catalog_name (enable | disabled | Inherit) predective optimization
                                   Disadvantage : Not available in all regions. default retention of vaccum of 7 days

              Liquid Clustering : 
                                      
              
              
> External = Supports Unity. Performance and storage comes with manual efforts.
      Create external table tablename(
            columname datatype
           )
      Location path
> Foregin = No unity support. Only read operation can be performed. 

